{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5527", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在我收拾書包準備回家時，瀨名同學走到我的座位旁。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天能來嗎？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我打算過去。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5528", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，可以等我一下嗎？我盡快收拾好。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用急沒關係。」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5529", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我會晚一點才去你家打擾。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5530", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什麼事嗎？」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對。被學園長叫去了。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5531", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的表情有點不悅。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是那件事？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "合併終止的謠言還沒有平息。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是那件事。雖然已經沒有能做的、該做的事了，算是報告一下吧。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5532", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「久等了，瀨名同學。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ht1143", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太也一起啊，那我也去比較好嗎？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天只是報告而已，新吾不用來也沒關係吧。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ht1144", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，有什麼就打電話給我。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，那就再見啦。」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ht1145", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再見，瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5533", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯嗯。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我目送他們兩人離開教室。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3142", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃來到我的教室。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學有事去找學園長。」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我收到郵件了。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3143", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……她真是無懈可擊呢。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以想說今天就先回去。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3144", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也對，那我們走吧。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「歡迎，愛理。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3145", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾了。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5534", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要吃飯？洗澡？還是──」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3146", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然是用功準備考試。」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5535", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊唔……不愧是愛理，回答得這麼乾脆。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3147", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是當然的吧？因為我又不是來玩的。」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5536", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「歡迎，比我預料的還早呢。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5537", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的表情有一瞬間出現苦澀。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概是發生什麼事了。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然有點在意，但是現在櫻乃也在。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那今天就請多指教了。」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拜託了……愛理老師的私人教學。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3148", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「別這樣說啦，聽起來好邪惡的感覺。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5538", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，紅茶可以嗎？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3149", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳，櫻乃。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5539", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接過櫻乃端來的杯子，她喝了一口，然後吁了一口氣。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當老師很累？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3150", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不，不是那樣的。」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5540", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會……那件事怎麼了嗎？」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有點。還有……一些其他的事。」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5541", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放下杯子，她來回看了看我跟櫻乃。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是那件事？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3151", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「反正完全傳開了我就說吧，合併終止的事。」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5542", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我也聽說了，合併要終止。」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3152", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，傳得大家都知道了。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5543", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什麼新的動向嗎？」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛，她什麼都沒說，所以好像沒什麼改變。」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5544", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那瀨名同學的嘆氣就是……其他的事？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5545", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像是看不下去學生們被謠言影響而心浮氣躁，所以請我提醒他們注意一下。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5546", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是學園長說的？」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是資深的老師們。」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5547", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長就對那種情況本來就不會多說什麼，甚至可以說積極過頭……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5548", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結果就出問題了？」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也不到問題的程度。只是有些煩人的老師覺得這樣漫無紀律。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5549", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟結女是有歷史的女子學校呢。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對從以前就在的老師們來說，合併造成的缺點比較大。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。老實說我一開始也那麼想。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5550", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，對哥哥擺出冰塊一樣的態度。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3153", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個……抱歉。」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5551", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不介意喔，我想這是理所當然的反應。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……如果瓜生君不是這種個性，或許我現在也是同樣的態度。」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5552", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，現在融化了？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3154", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個形容有點那個呢……至少說『和解』吧。」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5553", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒什麼融化的感覺。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3155", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什麼關係，融化的話就不妙了吧？」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5554", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學笑了笑。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「多謝招待，很好喝。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5555", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她放下空了的杯子。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要續杯嗎？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3156", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝，但是不用了。反正還有一點時間。」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5556", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有時間的話，可以喝點什麼吧？」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3157", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，妳以為我是為了什麼才來這裡的？」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5557", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學笑著這樣說。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再多用功一下吧。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5558", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理老師的課後輔導。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk3158", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就說不要用那個說法了嘛！」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 319, "voice": "ar5559", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
